        'speakers.2022.krzysztof.full': '<p>Born in England to Polish parents, Krzysztof has lived in the Highlands of Scotland for over 35 years. In 2015, he opened a successful independent high school with actress Tilda Swinton which drew attention from the Scottish government.</p><p>He was invited to the Queen\'s Garden Party and has given talks on educational renewal in New Zealand, India, Mexico, Taiwan, and around Europe. Apart from being a headteacher, he specializes in making clay pizza ovens, Canadian canoes, and hand-forged knives with students.</p>',
