        'speakers.2022.urszula.full': '<p>Graduate of Medical Academy in Gdańsk, worked as a pediatrician for over 30 years. After being diagnosed with Parkinson\'s disease, established the Park On Association in 2019 for people with Parkinson\'s and their caregivers.</p><p>The association offers free art therapy, physical exercise, Tai Chi, and psychological workshops. Organized Poland\'s first Dance for PD course with David Leventhal from New York.</p>',
